            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPV-250, Solid Brass 2-1/2 Oval Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2 Inch Oval Ring Pull is a great way to spruce up any cabinet. It adds a point of intrest that is unique, making it a great finishing touch to any remodel. The Solid Brass 2-1/2 Oval Ring Pull can be installed on any lightweight door or drawer, making it really versatile.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/2-inch-oval-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpv-200\">Small Oval Finger Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Oval RPV250 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
